    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>Microsoft Graph API integration with Azure Event Grid is now available in public preview. This integration enables you to subscribe to events from Azure AD, Outlook, SharePoint, Teams and more.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://techcommunity.microsoft.com/t5/messaging-on-azure-blog/new-event-sources-for-event-grid-azure-ad-outlook-teams/ba-p/3489471\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more.</a></p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Microsoft Graph API integration with Azure Event Grid is now available in public preview. This integration enables you to subscribe to events from Azure AD, Outlook, SharePoint, Teams and more.\n\nLearn more."
  },
